WEBVTT

00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:35.197
making sure that it is diverse, equitable,
accessible and sustainable.

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:39.763
This is just the beginning
of the decentralized movement.

00:10:40.797 --> 00:10:44.597
NFTs will revolutionize
most online industries,

00:10:44.597 --> 00:10:46.997
but it is starting
with the creative economy.

00:10:48.363 --> 00:10:51.463
While nothing in this talk
is financial advice,

00:10:51.497 --> 00:10:53.730
it is definitely educational
encouragement.

00:10:54.463 --> 00:10:57.063
And why not start learning through art?

00:10:57.663 --> 00:10:58.830
Jump in.

00:10:58.830 --> 00:10:59.997
We need you.